# Secrets never belong in a deployed bundle.
#
# Vercel's file tracer follows dotenv's read of .env and pulls the file into
# the function. It is gitignored, so it never reaches GitHub — but a CLI
# deploy uploads from this directory, which would ship the database password,
# the Supabase service role key and the Gmail app password as a readable file
# inside the deployment.
#
# Configuration comes from Vercel's own environment variables instead.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Uploaded member photos live in Supabase Storage; this directory is only a
# local development fallback and can be large.
uploads
